
!.env.example
# Dart/Flutter
# Env & secrets (Security ADR s7: never commit the service role)
# IDE / OS
# Melos / pub workspaces: local dependency link files are generated and must
# Riverpod / build_runner generated glue (apps/mobile). Machine-produced by
# `dart run build_runner build`; regenerated on the build machine, never
# hand-maintained (and excluded from analysis via apps/mobile/analysis_options.yaml).
# never be committed (Melos migration guide).
# نسخ احتياطية محلية مؤقتة (لا تُرفع للريبو)
*.bak_*
*.g.dart
*.g.dart.lock
*.iml
*.jks
*.log
--list
.DS_Store
.admin_dropdowns_backup_*/
.dart_tool/
.env
.env.*
.format-fix-backup-*/
.fvm/flutter_sdk
.idea/
.packages
.step-*-backup-*/
.step-*-fix-backup-*/
.vscode/
android_backup_*/
apply_7_*.sh
apps/mobile/android/
build/
coverage/
docker-build.log
keystore_b64.txt
nukhbaa-current.zip
pubspec_overrides.yaml
# سكربتات جلسات مؤقتة (توليد/تطبيق تلقائي) — لا تُتبَّع في git
run_*.sh
apply_*.sh
fix_*.sh
01_admin_fixture_review_backend.sh
[0-9][0-9]_*.sh

# امتدادات .py المكافئة لسكربتات الجلسات المؤقتة أعلاه (كانت مفقودة)
apply_*.py
fix_*.py
step*.py
phase*.sh
run_part1_verify*.sh
*.tar.gz
